{"model":"nomic-embed-text:latest","input":["museum exhibit shipping source note: the conservation lab calibrates another humidity sensor.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the volunteer desk posts an unrelated rota.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the board room stores a separate meeting packet.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the loading bay marks another crate for return.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the curator updates an unrelated object biography.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the storage room reserves another pallet space.","museum exhibit shipping source note: the museum director signs a separate approval memo.","Which inventory details came from one field station intake record?","Field station generator FS-18 has serial number GEN-8831.","Generator FS-18 is stored on rack B-04 in the field station equipment shed.","The spare battery assigned to generator FS-18 is labeled BAT-22.","The field station inventory custodian for generator FS-18 is Imani Cole.","field station equipment inventory: the weather mast uses a separate calibration notebook.","field station equipment inventory: the satellite phone has an unrelated charging pouch.","field station equipment inventory: the sample freezer keeps a different temperature log.","field station equipment inventory: the trail camera kit is stored in an auxiliary cabinet."],"truncate":false}